# Git submodule configuration for bible data
# To add a bible data submodule, run:
# git submodule add <repository-url> data/bible-texts

# Example:
# git submodule add https://github.com/your-org/hebrew-bible-json.git data/bible-texts

# The system will automatically detect and load JSON files from:
# - data/*.json (direct files)
# - data/*/*.json (files in subdirectories like submodules)